-band bounds. Releasing within 100 points of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"center on both axes pulses Reset, matching the placed graph’s snap-to-origin branch.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView"}}}